#env MBUI_WIN=1280x800
# The wide frame (a desktop's window, src/sfapp/wide.mbt): the test chat pressed in the sidebar's list opens beside
# it; words typed in its composer go with Enter, as the web's do; the bubble, then sent.
timeout 60000
until 新建对话
until 端到端测试
tap 端到端测试
until 按空格输入
wait 800
shot 1-open
tap 按空格输入
type 宽屏里发出的消息 {T}
shot 2-typed
enter
until 宽屏里发出的消息 {T}
gone 正在发送
shot 3-sent
